        "Content": "<ul><li> Fabulous, semi-detached family home</li><li> Quiet, mature location adjacent to the DART line</li><li> Spacious footprint of 164 sq mt</li><li> Large front garden with off street parking and garage access</li><li> Sun-drenched rear garden (Extension potential s.t.p.p) 100 ft in length</li><li> Close to Ballsbridge & Sandymount village & Sandymount strand</li><li> Close to excellent junior & senior schools</li><li> Close to terrific public transport links</ul>"
